1. Dohai dohai khudara dohai<br />
Ye dashte bala me hai kesi tabahi<br />
bahaya hai kisne ye khoone mohd<br />
qayamat ye dhai hai kisne ilaahi<br />
jawano buzurgo ko maara gaya hai<br />
shahido me shamil hai nanha sipahi <br />
