3. Uthi apne marqad se binte mohd<br />
siyah shab ki chadar me chehra chupakar<br />
gayi karbala me to usne ye dekha<br />
hai bosida kurte me ek laashe besar<br />
badan saara teero se chalni pada hai<br />
lahu me hai dooba hua saara paikar<br />
Husain al-ghareeb al-ghareeb al-Husain<br />
Husain as-shaheed as-shaheed al-Husain..(2)<br />
