4. tadap kar wo chillai shabbir beta<br />
lahu me nahaye ho sar bhi juda hai<br />
tabar kisne maare hai saare badan par<br />
ye teero pe kisne janaza rakha hai<br />
kaha hai mera laal abbas bolo<br />
mai puchungi usse ye kese hua hai<br />
