5. Sada sunke zahra ki tharrae ghazi<br />
juda tan se sar tha to shane kate the<br />
ghamo yaas o hasrat me majrooho muztar<br />
kahe kya ke darya kanare pade the<br />
sue alqama ab jo bibi ne dekha<br />
batao ke sahil pe thande pade the<br />
Husain al-ghareeb al-ghareeb al-Husain<br />
Husain as-shaheed as-shaheed al-Husain..(2)<br />
