6. Idhar dard o ghum ki satai thi zainab<br />
jo wehshat ke jungle me haider bani thi<br />
kabhi khaak udati kabhi ashk piti<br />
jo kunbe ke pehre pe tanha khadi thi<br />
sakina ke saqqa ko aawaz dekar<br />
ghame shahedeen me buka kar rhi thi<br />
Husain al-ghareeb al-ghareeb al-Husain<br />
Husain as-shaheed as-shaheed al-Husain..(2)<br />
<br />
7. guzarish hai aaqa hamari yahi<br />
humko roze pe maula bula lijiye<br />
humko zawwar maula bana lijiye<br />
humko daaman me maula chupa lijiye<br />
giraftar zoro-sitam hum hue hai<br />
musibat se humko bacha lijiye<br />
Husain al-ghareeb al-ghareeb al-Husain<br />
Husain as-shaheed as-shaheed al-Husain..(2)<br />
<br />
8. kabhi dil me deti wo maa ko sadae<br />
kabhi roke kehti ke baba kaha ho<br />
shahido ka nauha tha uske zaba par<br />
abad kis tarah uske ghum ka baya ho<br />
hume bhi sa'adat ho nusrat ki hasil<br />
khudara zahoore imame zama ho<br />
